# pnpm 11 regenerates this locally to gate build scripts (sharp/unrs-resolver).
# It must NOT be committed: the server runs pnpm 9, which treats the file as a
# workspace declaration and fails with "packages field missing or empty".
# Build-script approval for the server lives in package.json (pnpm.onlyBuiltDependencies).
